cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "XRef Code — Ultra Blazing Fast x86-64 ELF Cross-References & Pseudo-C Decompiler"
abstract: >-
  Ultra blazing fast, zero-index x86-64 ELF binary cross-reference analyzer,
  struct layout recovery engine, backward program slicer, cross-build logic
  differ, and structured typed pseudo-C decompiler in pure safe Rust. Function
  ranges are recovered from .eh_frame unwind tables with span fallback and
  decoded in parallel across CPU cores in milliseconds without maintaining an
  on-disk database.
